   "durationSec": 12.07,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V2-2.mp3",
   "text": "Now see it from inside your own eyes. Not watching yourself from across the room. Looking out, the way you will when it happens. What is in front of you? Who is there? What are your hands doing?"
