   "durationSec": 13.84,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V6-5.mp3",
   "text": "And see yourself meeting the next thing, from the inside. Not perfectly. Fully. The drop and the return are now one trained sequence, rather than a hope."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V6-6",
   "exerciseId": "V6",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "knbv2zCRc8OJxKRM3ph1",
   "sessionId": "dMiXGS4lIFGHQH0LZ442",
   "generationId": "mBbDcJjoa7qd0ktmdRM6",
   "durationSec": 7.24,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V6-6.mp3",
   "text": "Let the scene go. What you just rehearsed is recovery, and recovery is the part that can be trained."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V7-1",
   "exerciseId": "V7",
   "narrator": "curious",
   "voiceId": "Jx35Jvky2ob4xi16g1ha",
   "voiceName": "Miss La",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "pKC0uOmPvIzv4OEtrRJx",
   "sessionId": "CVVtrFsZVeig9hT741RK",
   "generationId": "40SREVXcFBADPTnc0l4U",
   "durationSec": 13.14,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/curious/V7-1.mp3",
   "text": "Bring to mind a moment coming up where you will be seen, by people whose opinion matters to you. Now populate it. Put the specific people there. Name them to yourself."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V7-2",
   "exerciseId": "V7",
   "narrator": "curious",
   "voiceId": "Jx35Jvky2ob4xi16g1ha",
   "voiceName": "Miss La",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "CxWRFH4hitsozFr0yCcT",
   "sessionId": "KlDoTpkWz1545UFq3GLB",
   "generationId": "deGsHLmHfSBWhQmNh0fv",
   "durationSec": 7.94,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/curious/V7-2.mp3",
   "text": "See where each of them is. Notice what happens in your body when they are present. That reaction is information, not a problem."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V7-3",
   "exerciseId": "V7",
   "narrator": "curious",
   "voiceId": "Jx35Jvky2ob4xi16g1ha",
   "voiceName": "Miss La",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "BSO9HEAGovVKSnwIdG2Y",
   "sessionId": "M7XMR6foJe4qKPylX8X1",
   "generationId": "tmquUGBnBzgBEEzHPUwb",
   "durationSec": 9.1,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/curious/V7-3.mp3",
   "text": "Now go through the moment, from the inside, with them watching. Start to finish. Let any tightness be there, and go through it anyway."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V7-4",
   "exerciseId": "V7",
   "narrator": "curious",
   "voiceId": "Jx35Jvky2ob4xi16g1ha",
   "voiceName": "Miss La",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "m0D3IY44bpNxSlAuExZa",
   "sessionId": "zAY8bFmX6kPUMxwxCEbQ",
   "generationId": "tQErPzayInwLftyanu7H",
   "durationSec": 7.34,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/curious/V7-4.mp3",
   "text": "Again, with them still there. Notice whether the body has already started to treat their presence as familiar."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V7-5",
   "exerciseId": "V7",
   "narrator": "curious",
   "voiceId": "Jx35Jvky2ob4xi16g1ha",
   "voiceName": "Miss La",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "fPXhjwwc7SdCBD6qWPcG",
   "sessionId": "q4D1CsIK76vhdJTPq2gg",
   "generationId": "Y4o5YbYv8xd0ZT82462y",
   "durationSec": 9.85,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/curious/V7-5.mp3",
   "text": "Let them fade, then let the scene fade. Being watched changes the body before it changes thought. You just gave your system a rehearsal."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V8-1",
   "exerciseId": "V8",
   "narrator": "active",
   "voiceId": "lqydY2xVUkg9cEIFmFMU",
   "voiceName": "Angela",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "MlZBkIMQBAoX2a9PLE8P",
   "sessionId": "65tunuec3mUKidOtSdBk",
   "generationId": "82bM2H3ehSVCae2Y7BXv",
   "durationSec": 9.75,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V8-1.mp3",
   "text": "Bring back one real moment from your own life that went exactly as you intended. Not a highlight someone else chose. One of yours. Any part of life counts."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V8-2",
   "exerciseId": "V8",
   "narrator": "active",
   "voiceId": "lqydY2xVUkg9cEIFmFMU",
   "voiceName": "Angela",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "0IcNc4o9PvX4IzEl8RqV",
   "sessionId": "GYPn4weuU1l6zrGZPp4R",
   "generationId": "Ria7w5m0yzwo0lZQ29Qu",
   "durationSec": 9.66,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V8-2.mp3",
   "text": "Rebuild it with as much detail as you can recover. The light. The sounds. What you could feel in your body as it was working. Let it play through once."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V8-3",
   "exerciseId": "V8",
   "narrator": "active",
   "voiceId": "lqydY2xVUkg9cEIFmFMU",
   "voiceName": "Angela",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "I6AdBf8YycfPe4oUX793",
   "sessionId": "6SIpLj84U7CdarUXRrTm",
   "generationId": "tkFg0HzpY138i1DjrYHh",
   "durationSec": 9.15,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V8-3.mp3",
   "text": "Now a second one. A different day, the same quality. Find the sensory detail again, especially the feeling of the moment it came together."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V8-4",
   "exerciseId": "V8",
   "narrator": "active",
   "voiceId": "lqydY2xVUkg9cEIFmFMU",
   "voiceName": "Angela",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "6d9bHF84Qaa6BnBlkkX5",
   "sessionId": "DFVXKrmu64OgaTPXHYDl",
   "generationId": "HLxDccV7Ca12eEfIG6Mp",
   "durationSec": 9.38,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V8-4.mp3",
   "text": "And a third. Three real moments, from your own body, in a row. This is not pretending. This is remembering what you are capable of."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V8-5",
   "exerciseId": "V8",
   "narrator": "active",
   "voiceId": "lqydY2xVUkg9cEIFmFMU",
   "voiceName": "Angela",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "oFIcjqmf3eRvBhpNqqgF",
   "sessionId": "LvTtrONMSyCMgeJUEpHc",
   "generationId": "Iv0ipj0qTVYzAPiOugLc",
   "durationSec": 2.51,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V8-5.mp3",
   "text": "Let the last one settle. Carry it with you."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V9-1",
   "exerciseId": "V9",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "WhQBAMpKmM8O9YxEEtic",
   "sessionId": "r8jGuG6cJLkUYretOxNO",
   "generationId": "heHxIYmEaK7rV9KlAmrW",
   "durationSec": 10.73,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V9-1.mp3",
   "text": "This one is not about the effort. It is about the minute after. Picture yourself just after something that took something out of you. The thing is done."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V9-2",
   "exerciseId": "V9",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "cNZYBtWyXk2zeEGHIv7V",
   "sessionId": "cjps37XZSWQeJyzOf290",
   "generationId": "1TpOMuMXVHuIDDfrYlKE",
   "durationSec": 10.54,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V9-2.mp3",
   "text": "See the shoulders drop. Not forced. Just the weight coming off them. See the eyes lift and take in something further away."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V9-3",
   "exerciseId": "V9",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "cQiFgCbIXMFi0KRe5wli",
   "sessionId": "E1sqUHRH1htcOHvYXLqV",
   "generationId": "N20hYEeLKrUQlPNNOBtX",
   "durationSec": 9.47,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V9-3.mp3",
   "text": "See the breath lengthen on its own. In through the nose. Longer out. The mind going quiet without being told to."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V9-4",
   "exerciseId": "V9",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "WXgdChy6lXRpY1MPi15k",
   "sessionId": "nFNBmCMQHpkHfPnOUm4Y",
   "generationId": "ENOiLnFzzneojSRmXLXm",
   "durationSec": 11.61,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V9-4.mp3",
   "text": "That is the walk. Most of any demanding day is the recovery between efforts, and recovery is the part you can train. Rehearse it once more."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V9-5",
   "exerciseId": "V9",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "7rN1aI6w2x10wE0udLW9",
   "sessionId": "NSPEalsCkcYSFX1ALNQe",
   "generationId": "2VWCSHlfKqG1vN5pLF44",
   "durationSec": 5.25,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V9-5.mp3",
   "text": "Let it go. You now have a picture of what settling looks like from the inside."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V10-1",
   "exerciseId": "V10",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "XlgxG0KP68JtR7gAXmhD",
   "sessionId": "Hf2O5pVnb2oBMINbUUT6",
   "generationId": "qvDajalSklkMUlDC949H",
   "durationSec": 13.7,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V10-1.mp3",
   "text": "Build a place. Real or imagined, it does not matter. One place where your system settles the moment you arrive. Choose it now, and stay with it."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V10-2",
   "exerciseId": "V10",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "hgrb6NchxquKjFfcBdPP",
   "sessionId": "PTIx35ipMhA5NYR94BtG",
   "generationId": "PhNmWL1vgVSTEv7C6f4K",
   "durationSec": 10.31,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V10-2.mp3",
   "text": "Add the detail. What is under your feet. What the air is like. What you can hear. The further away the horizon, the better."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V10-3",
   "exerciseId": "V10",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "2MkgqJ31LFyITYh1unvk",
   "sessionId": "uN30yunnio2HE9RE0AVL",
   "generationId": "YskShdeADXADDhOl3yLi",
   "durationSec": 10.31,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V10-3.mp3",
   "text": "Find where you sit or stand in it. Feel the support under you. Let the breath find its own slow rhythm here."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V10-4",
   "exerciseId": "V10",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "GxIwtqAElIFy0Cxtvfa1",
   "sessionId": "7DGeRpYsoDGlYIXYndut",
   "generationId": "NKxwtqcnwOSrM5jV5qi7",
   "durationSec": 12.35,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V10-4.mp3",
   "text": "This is your sanctuary. The aim is to be able to reach it in three breaths, anywhere, with your eyes open. That takes repetition, and this is one."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V10-5",
   "exerciseId": "V10",
   "narrator": "interoceptive",
   "voiceId": "aZmUfPlx1GDZ4UDKlP7Q",
   "voiceName": "Calm Meditative Steve",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "50wT2zrrapZWnkoISVf0",
   "sessionId": "HlUNvjstojdzcTPRuTf9",
   "generationId": "n4HIdf2sL7ehN6lf8UVo",
   "durationSec": 4.92,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/interoceptive/V10-5.mp3",
   "text": "Take three breaths here. Then come back to the room, and know the way."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V11-1",
   "exerciseId": "V11",
   "narrator": "curious",
   "voiceId": "Jx35Jvky2ob4xi16g1ha",
   "voiceName": "Miss La",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "pnzkOuHLwDt4UWAWIbcX",
   "sessionId": "ANmJcnhOSYFQiBB9fAl6",
   "generationId": "ykZFI0MHqUiw7TejLeMM",
   "durationSec": 11.56,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/curious/V11-1.mp3",
   "text": "Open your eyes. Let your attention go wide. Take in the whole room. The edges of your vision. The ceiling. The sounds from outside. Everything at once, nothing in particular."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V11-2",
   "exerciseId": "V11",
   "narrator": "curious",
   "voiceId": "Jx35Jvky2ob4xi16g1ha",
   "voiceName": "Miss La",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "Ro0hc2MePOirldUrbm3d",
   "sessionId": "HrxQgOsrjoK2mAQliZ8J",
   "generationId": "MPxeI7jNLK98SpOdc6K8",
   "durationSec": 6.59,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/curious/V11-2.mp3",
   "text": "Now narrow. One point, close, specific. Hold it. Everything else drops away."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V11-3",
   "exerciseId": "V11",
   "narrator": "curious",
   "voiceId": "Jx35Jvky2ob4xi16g1ha",
   "voiceName": "Miss La",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "n8mHet7r212FP0KtDFhv",
   "sessionId": "lFaNfw8xGEfzCd9LkkzY",
   "generationId": "YvSISoMbaw7JUfCAzdGu",
   "durationSec": 5.85,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/curious/V11-3.mp3",
   "text": "Wide again. The whole field. Notice how different the body feels when attention is open."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V11-4",
   "exerciseId": "V11",
   "narrator": "curious",
   "voiceId": "Jx35Jvky2ob4xi16g1ha",
   "voiceName": "Miss La",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "Ehmaim5ViCWJFv7ZWbKU",
   "sessionId": "vM3sQXz8quHX6joNZg0b",
   "generationId": "FcvKy5lIlfuzshGAcKgm",
   "durationSec": 5.29,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/curious/V11-4.mp3",
   "text": "Narrow. One point. And wide. One more cycle. Narrow. And wide."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V11-5",
   "exerciseId": "V11",
   "narrator": "curious",
   "voiceId": "Jx35Jvky2ob4xi16g1ha",
   "voiceName": "Miss La",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "gW4UMaVY4KlJkaKvGTVd",
   "sessionId": "S9ZPim25QBIdWGYCPdZ7",
   "generationId": "6FKbeCYSc8meJUTaamb4",
   "durationSec": 7.2,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/curious/V11-5.mp3",
   "text": "Attention width is a control you operate, not a condition that happens to you. You just moved it six times on purpose."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V12-1",
   "exerciseId": "V12",
   "narrator": "active",
   "voiceId": "lqydY2xVUkg9cEIFmFMU",
   "voiceName": "Angela",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "oCSPamv6dYKOa4R9DpTp",
   "sessionId": "W6QMEHz11MCBsAp8asyV",
   "generationId": "iiiXyV7SRXKNJII3WIxt",
   "durationSec": 7.57,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V12-1.mp3",
   "text": "See yourself finishing something that mattered to you. Not the result. The finish. The way you carry yourself in the last minute of it."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V12-2",
   "exerciseId": "V12",
   "narrator": "active",
   "voiceId": "lqydY2xVUkg9cEIFmFMU",
   "voiceName": "Angela",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "vkU0dArfbjaSgosTa6YE",
   "sessionId": "glI1nBLIs29NxVxSiTQN",
   "generationId": "S8UxvowA4wI7JTbLBzmp",
   "durationSec": 7.94,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V12-2.mp3",
   "text": "Now make it specific. Decide how you want to be known for finishing, whatever the outcome. See that version of you walk away from it."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V12-3",
   "exerciseId": "V12",
   "narrator": "active",
   "voiceId": "lqydY2xVUkg9cEIFmFMU",
   "voiceName": "Angela",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "s3J9YvCMpfbCXce1Um5M",
   "sessionId": "oyjq7cfbMitx4mNgkhRh",
   "generationId": "DZSrYLu5zbZzOeSHeTFW",
   "durationSec": 5.02,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V12-3.mp3",
   "text": "Run it again, and this time let the outcome be a good one. The finish looks the same."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V12-4",
   "exerciseId": "V12",
   "narrator": "active",
   "voiceId": "lqydY2xVUkg9cEIFmFMU",
   "voiceName": "Angela",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "rRSaIDg2rq3jHRzmVxJS",
   "sessionId": "24FQoa2ayB37rFG4Tt22",
   "generationId": "qipyA97x1g2hwIJI5FMU",
   "durationSec": 10.26,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V12-4.mp3",
   "text": "Run it once more, and let the outcome be a poor one. The finish still looks the same. That is the point of this practice. It is an identity, not a mood."
  },
  {
   "segmentId": "V12-5",
   "exerciseId": "V12",
   "narrator": "active",
   "voiceId": "lqydY2xVUkg9cEIFmFMU",
   "voiceName": "Angela",
   "flowId": "a8TW5V11lkq5UJxK0d6H",
   "nodeId": "XQqe76tUdAErsJRcy8k6",
   "sessionId": "DrRiC2cLbgURApfhz60a",
   "generationId": "YMmuhrWHEBhsVaO1lENk",
   "durationSec": 4.18,
   "storagePath": "practice/narration/active/V12-5.mp3",
   "text": "Let it settle. This is the picture the whole practice points toward."
  }
 ]
